# Join a colony from the map. Fixture: free colonist #128 standing on the Quebec (45,24) colony tile is
# selected (head.active_unit, cursor stuff.x/y); full moves, no orders.
key b                      # B on an own colony tile = Join Colony: #128 joins Quebec (pop 6 -> 7) on a free land tile,
                           # leaves the unit list (FUN_1427_0824 raw 7834-7836 steps the active index back one record):
                           # #127 (in Europe) fails the re-test, so the goto Colonist that slid into #128's slot comes up,
                           # finishes its go-to at (41,24) by road and waits there with moves left
